  "specialRules": [
    {
      "name": "Seamen",
      "text": "All Norse warriors get +2 Strength when trying to row a boat."
    },
    {
      "name": "Norse special skills",
      "text": "Shield Master: with a shield may parry with it in addition to the natural-12 save (6+ in d6). Berserk Charge: with an axe or double-handed weapon, re-roll all failed to-hit rolls when charging. Crushing Blow: no enemy may parry this hero's attacks. Battle Tongue (leader skill only): models within 12\" use his Leadership. Barbarian Courage: never takes all alone tests and may re-roll failed fear tests."
    }
